{
  "_comment": [
    "PLACEHOLDER. This is not a working Firebase config and the build does not",
    "read it: Gradle looks for `google-services.json` in this same directory,",
    "which is gitignored because the real file names a real Firebase project.",
    "",
    "TO MAKE ANDROID PUSH LIVE (weekend step, needs the Play/Firebase account):",
    "  1. console.firebase.google.com, create a project (or reuse one).",
    "  2. Add an Android app to it with package name com.pubmaxx.app.",
    "  3. Download the google-services.json it hands back.",
    "  4. Save it as android/app/google-services.json. Do not commit it.",
    "  5. In the same Firebase project: Project settings, Service accounts,",
    "     Generate new private key. That JSON is the SERVER half and is a real",
    "     secret. Never put it in the repository or in the app.",
    "  6. Set FCM_PROJECT_ID, FCM_CLIENT_EMAIL, FCM_PRIVATE_KEY_ID and",
    "     FCM_PRIVATE_KEY on the server from that service-account JSON.",
    "     All four, or lib/fcmPushProvider.ts refuses rather than half-sending.",
    "  7. Rebuild and prove a real delivery on a device: registration token",
    "     posted to /api/push-tokens, notification received, tap lands on the",
    "     path the payload named.",
    "",
    "The shape below is the shape the real file has, with every value replaced.",
    "It exists so a reader can tell at a glance which fields are account-owned."
  ],
  "project_info": {
    "project_number": "REPLACE_WITH_FIREBASE_PROJECT_NUMBER",
    "project_id": "REPLACE_WITH_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID",
    "storage_bucket": "REPLACE_WITH_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET"
  },
  "client": [
    {
      "client_info": {
        "mobilesdk_app_id": "REPLACE_WITH_FIREBASE_MOBILESDK_APP_ID",
        "android_client_info": {
          "package_name": "com.pubmaxx.app"
        }
      },
      "oauth_client": [],
      "api_key": [
        {
          "current_key": "REPLACE_WITH_FIREBASE_ANDROID_API_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "services": {
        "appinvite_service": {
          "other_platform_oauth_client": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "configuration_version": "1"
}
